      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Features & Services:</li><li> Modern, B3 rated detached family home in a small bespoke residential development.</li><li> Spacious, well-appointed accommodation measuring 248sqm/2,669sq.ft.</li><li> A nice corner plot with a private southwest facing sunny garden with a paved patio and mature border planting.</li><li> Panoramic views over the Sugarloaf mountains and The Glen of the Downs.</li><li> Smart homes technology with surround sound systems in certain rooms.</li><li> High quality Alno kitchen with granite worktop and a selection of high end appliances including a Neff coffee machine, Kuppersbusch combi grill/oven/microwave, Britannia gas hob with electric oven and warming drawer.</li><li> Private pedestrian gated access into Avoca Handweavers.</li><li> Built in wardrobes in all the bedrooms.</li><li> GFCH with individual thermostat controls.</li><li> Underfloor heating in kitchen.</li><li> Alarmed </li><li> LED recessed lighting.</li><li> NBI broadband service is available.</li><li> Central vacuum system</li><li> Dark mahogany arched doorways, architraves and skirting.</li><li> Three bedrooms ensuite.</li><li> High ceilings with coving.</li><li> Mains water and sewerage.</ul>"
